  "story": {
    "language": "en",
    "translationLanguage": "zh-Hant",
    "textEn": "Our team meets on the playground for a race today. I check each shoe before I run with my friends. A bright flag is near the end of the race. I am fast, but my friend is slow at first. We are strong and keep going until we finish. Then we jump for fun beside the basketball area. A child plays with a ball near our teacher. Soon we are tired and sit down to drink water. We smile and talk about what we can try next.",
    "textZh": "今天我們的隊伍在操場集合參加比賽。和朋友跑步前，我檢查兩腳的鞋子。比賽終點附近有一面鮮明的旗幟。我跑得快，但朋友一開始較慢。我們很強壯，繼續努力直到完成。接著我們在籃球區旁開心地跳躍。一個孩子在老師附近玩球。很快我們累了，坐下來喝水。我們笑著討論下次可以試試什麼。",
